The '''Verdant Summit''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Verdant Summit''' is a small plateau near the {{Zone|North Reaches}} with [[Fig Log|Fig Tree]]s to chop. Additionally, [[Lushlilac|Lushlilac Bushes]] can be picked for {{Item|Lushlilac}}s, and a river runs through the inside of the hill.

